{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13109220","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13109220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310922001:1":{"text":"당연히 제전에 먼저 가야지. 탐험을 하려면 음식과 도구를 준비해야 하는 데다가 늪에 가려면 여러 가지 계획도 세워야 할 텐데...","source_cn":"当然是先去祭典，我们还得准备探险时的食物和工具呢，而且...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE33FC2A8DE87B311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310922002:1":{"text":"맞아. 미로 괴담은 몇 년 동안이나 지속되었으니, 제전이 끝나고 가도 똑같을 거야.","source_cn":"的确，迷路怪谈持续了那么多年了，祭典结束再去也一样。<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA07ACA5DC35C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310922003:1":{"text":"어... 여러분은...","source_cn":"呃……你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3242EF50657E4D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310922004:1":{"text":"여러분! 드디어 찾았네요! 어디 갔었어요? 저랑 같이 제전에 참가하기로 했었잖아요.","source_cn":"嗨——你们，总算找到你们了！你们跑到哪里去了？说好要跟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35404746F59A558F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310922005:1":{"text":"공주님! 여기 계셨군요... 괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"公主殿下！你在这里啊……你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF857C97C3B405768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310922006:1":{"text":"저요? 무슨 소리예요? 전 멀쩡한걸요! 다들 어딜 갔었던 거예요? 저와 함께 놀지 않구!","source_cn":"我？你在说什么呢，我很好呀！倒是你们不知道跑哪去了，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9D7957BF135259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310922007:1":{"text":"공주님! 그리고 여러분, 처음 뵙겠습니다. 안녕하세요, 전 크리스토프라고 해요.","source_cn":"公主殿下！还有这几位朋友，初次见面，你好，我叫克什托夫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060CE15DE70CE698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310922007":{"text":"공주님! 그리고 여러분, 처음 뵙겠습니다. 안녕하세요, 전 크리스토프라고 해요.","source_cn":"公主殿下！还有这几位朋友，初次见面，你好，我叫克什托夫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060CE15DE70CE698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310922010:1":{"text":"두 명이 모자란다고요?","source_cn":"少了两个人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A2F1C3E10A4D82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310922011:1":{"text":"음... 아니요? 줄곧 저희 둘 밖에 없었는걸요.","source_cn":"呃……好像没有吧？一直就只有我们两个啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11FE3EA0525D2008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310922012:1":{"text":"우선 제전에 참가하러 가시죠! 음, 눈싸움부터 하러 가는 건 어때요?","source_cn":"别想那么多了，咱们先去参加祭典吧！嗯，先去打雪仗怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6B0004EAB0B7C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310922013:1":{"text":"눈싸움? 다 같이 가는 건 어때요? 누가 더 잘하는지 시합을 하는 거죠!","source_cn":"打雪仗？不如我们一起吧，我们来比赛看谁更厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389B1679CF69632D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310922014:1":{"text":"양쪽은... 아, 그쪽은 두 명이고, 저희는 네 명이니까... 저와 한팀이 되면 눈싸움 시합을 할 수 있겠어요!","source_cn":"我们双方……啊，你们有两个人，我们有四个人。我和你们一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA86A0FA61FB2343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310922015:1":{"text":"공주님, 로드리고 씨는요?","source_cn":"公主殿下，罗德里戈先生呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF8F42C5FC73F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310922016:1":{"text":"로드리고? 아, 참... 제가 먼저 성으로 돌아가서 무도회에서 입을 예복을 가져다 달라고 했어요.","source_cn":"罗德里戈？他……哦，对了……我让他先回城堡为我去取舞会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14E1973086896245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1310922017:1":{"text":"우선 로드리고는 신경 쓰지 말고, 신나게 놀아보아요!","source_cn":"哎呀，别管他了，他不在，我们正好先玩个痛快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38E7BB06CF9C8DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310922018:1":{"text":"이상하네... 또 무언가가 달라진 것 같아요...","source_cn":"奇怪……好像又变得有点不一样了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CF7F4F9FFCEB82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"사람이 두 명 부족한 것 같은데?","source_cn":"你们是不是少了两个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB050439B98A731C4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사람이 두 명 부족한 것 같은데?","female":"사람이 두 명 부족한 것 같은데?","variant_male_record_index":"67724","variant_female_record_index":"67725","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310922008:1":{"text":"네? 제가 여러분을 알아야 하나요? 아닌데... 베르샤바, 저 분들 본 적 있어?","source_cn":"啊？我应该认识你们吗？不对啊……薇丝莎娃，你见过他们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x442CBBA0A50BF18B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310922009:1":{"text":"글쎄... 사람을 잘못 보신 것 같은데.","source_cn":"没有……你们一定是认错人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE82451D8E6AC870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choi